        },
        {
          "text": " Israeli Akasafiri, pamoja na yote aliyokuwa nayo, akaja Beer-sheba, akamchinjia sadaka Mungu wa Isaka babaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
